{"type":"standard","title":"David Valadao","displaytitle":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">David Valadao</span></span>","namespace":{"id":0,"text":""},"wikibase_item":"Q3528567","titles":{"canonical":"David_Valadao","normalized":"David Valadao","display":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">David Valadao</span></span>"},"pageid":30109055,"thumbnail":{"source":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/be/David_Valadao_117th_U.S_Congress.jpg/330px-David_Valadao_117th_U.S_Congress.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","width":330,"height":413},"originalimage":{"source":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/be/David_Valadao_117th_U.S_Congress.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","width":3250,"height":4063},"lang":"en","dir":"ltr","revision":"1377796336","tid":"d4789781-bd4d-11f1-9d49-65fca62c99ec","timestamp":"2026-10-01T04:09:00Z","description":"American politician and farmer (born 1977)","description_source":"local","content_urls":{"desktop":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/David_Valadao","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/David_Valadao?action=history","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/David_Valadao?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:David_Valadao"},"mobile":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/David_Valadao","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:History/David_Valadao","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/David_Valadao?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:David_Valadao"}},"extract":"David Goncalves Valadao is an American politician and former dairy farmer serving as the U.S. representative for California's 22nd congressional district since 2023, previously representing California's 21st congressional district. His district comprises part of the San Joaquin Valley. He is a member of the Republican Party.","extract_html":"<p><b>David Goncalves Valadao</b> is an American politician and former dairy farmer serving as the U.S. representative for California's 22nd congressional district since 2023, previously representing California's 21st congressional district. His district comprises part of the San Joaquin Valley. He is a member of the Republican Party.</p>"}